            "FocusScope",
            "ShortcutScope"
          ],
          "evidence": "lib/e/ui/widget.e (D806): Scope with traps_focus bounding Tab/Shift+Tab traversal in preorder with wrapping, up to eight Shortcut entries matched on key and modifiers, Enter as the default action and Escape as the cancel action resolved from the focused element upward; focused() for harnesses; tests/selfhost/fixtures/link/ui_gesture on both hosts"
        },
        {
          "id": "P0-04",
          "name": "Editable text primitive",
          "module": "e.ui.widget",
          "components": [
            "EditableText"
          ],
          "delivered": [
            "EditableText"
          ],
          "evidence": "lib/e/ui/widget.e (D807): Edit node over a caller-owned buffer with caret, anchor selection, hit-test placement and drag selection, typed text and IME composition, Backspace/Delete/Home/End/arrows, single-line submit and multiline breaks, clipboard copy/cut/paste with a runtime fallback, a 32-entry coalescing undo/redo history, and edit_value/edit_selection for harnesses; tests/selfhost/fixtures/link/ui_edit on both hosts"
        },
